        <infoLink name="Resilient (X)" id="41e4-855f-f82e-4180" hidden="false" targetId="253c-c1fa-d29d-d21e" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="1 Splintermind Combat Drugs" id="935d-461d-d04a-2fcb" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">For each attack made for this unit, that attack gains Isolate, and reroll a Hit Roll of 1 for that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2 Painbringer Combat Drugs" id="f7d6-0e2b-0273-912f" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">For each Resilient Roll made for this unit, add 1 to that roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4 Raider&apos;s Plunder" id="85bd-f188-9dc3-f334" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit gains this ability, roll 2 D6. Then, select a relic from an opponent&apos;s army rules&apos;relics table which matches any dice in that roll. Until this unit dies or loses that ability, your opponent cannot select that relic while capturing a vault. Then, this unit loses this ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="6 The Acquiescence" id="b951-4aff-b7bb-4ada" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit&apos;s Attacks step, for each enemy unit within 8&quot; of this unit with Suppressed X, select up to X non-leader infantry models from that unit. Then, each selected model dies (is enslaved).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="5 Mask of the First Age" id="dcc9-cf74-17da-7cb6" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">While enemy units are within 16&quot; of this unit, those units&apos;Rv is worsened by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3 Phantasm Grenades" id="1d3c-852e-efd2-e0f5" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit&apos;s Move step, select an enemy unit within 12&quot; of and visible to this unit. Until the End step, for each Resolve Test the selected unit succeeds, it suffers 1 SW. Then, the selected enemy unit suffers 2D6 Suppression.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
