            <characteristic name="Must Attach to" typeId="2c63-5e3f-9132-459d">This unit must attach to either:
a) KABALITE WARRIORS
b) KABALITE TRUEBORN
c) INCUBI</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Drink of their Agony" id="21b6-b799-9a02-d483" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s Attacks step, for each enemy unit with Suppressed X within 12&quot; of this unit, roll X D6 for that unit. For each 3+, that unit loses 1 H.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Shadowfield" id="a30b-8a43-ac0b-6309" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">Once per battle, after this unit&apos;s ARCHON model becomes the last model in this unit, all remaining attacks targeting this unit fail. Additionally, until the end of the battle round, this unit is an ineligible target for ranged attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
